    "body":  "## [1.5.1](https://github.com/TJ-CSCCG/TongjiThesis/compare/v1.5.0...v1.5.1) (2026-10-30)\n\n\n### 修正 | Fixes\n\n* align bibliography, tables and headings with the revised spec ([#137](https://github.com/TJ-CSCCG/TongjiThesis/issues/137)) ([39881a3](https://github.com/TJ-CSCCG/TongjiThesis/commit/39881a30668241b0749f87b0b40ce934595dffd9))\n* print biblatex like GB/T 7714-2025 and correct the guide ([#138](https://github.com/TJ-CSCCG/TongjiThesis/issues/138)) ([1425f65](https://github.com/TJ-CSCCG/TongjiThesis/commit/1425f657b369a8a79a092527d8f47e96c9e41675))\n\n\n### 文档与维护 | Docs \u0026 Maintenance\n\n* automate the promotion and back-sync steps ([#133](https://github.com/TJ-CSCCG/TongjiThesis/issues/133)) ([ec3004b](https://github.com/TJ-CSCCG/TongjiThesis/commit/ec3004bb51c8dd5b3f93c5a614bc7df3ee08ff84))\n* bump the github-actions group with 3 updates ([#131](https://github.com/TJ-CSCCG/TongjiThesis/issues/131)) ([64191c2](https://github.com/TJ-CSCCG/TongjiThesis/commit/64191c22d22eccca8ac455efc21a7ff860e8646a))\n* bump the github-actions group with 3 updates ([#135](https://github.com/TJ-CSCCG/TongjiThesis/issues/135)) ([b2cc1e2](https://github.com/TJ-CSCCG/TongjiThesis/commit/b2cc1e237ec6fcff896ee5ef45f529878c21dfbe))\n* merge master back into dev before promoting ([f56058a](https://github.com/TJ-CSCCG/TongjiThesis/commit/f56058acf169ae60602af665404423958f986d29))\n* point Dependabot at dev and document the release back-sync ([#132](https://github.com/TJ-CSCCG/TongjiThesis/issues/132)) ([1c86ada](https://github.com/TJ-CSCCG/TongjiThesis/commit/1c86ada3b341b85f09e645b77c78f6ba1ccfeb77))"
